From 4075f2e1265791864d9327c2eb309bc435e7788f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LeoDeadware <351117497+LeoDeadware@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 01:20:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 07/25] Launcher options: 30/60/120 fps (120 Hz vblank, game
 clock kept real), gamma, SSAO + emissive bloom, hold A to skip movies

120 fps: vblank at 119.88 Hz; the title's vblank counter 0x4289AC is kept at
59.94 Hz and the step floor 0x428EE8 halved (xbox_after_vblank_dpc), so game
time stays real (race: 4210 units/s at 119 fps vs 4060 at 60).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
